---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Inspect, validate and add kits

Usage: sbt kit [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  inspect   Show what a kit provides and requests
  validate  Check a kit without running it
  add       Add a mixin kit to an existing sandbox
  pack      Package a directory as a kit artifact
  push      Push a kit artifact to an OCI registry
  pull      Pull a kit artifact from an OCI registry
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
